{"unit_id":"GYINT__infoseek#card-zh","repo":"GYINT/infoseek","commit":"d7b81fdca5c39704a23609f8b00e04e11cf2d654","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Infoseek 是一个面向主题研究的 DSH 技能，通过入口读取并注册 SKILL.md，为 agent 提供从研究主题到结构化报告的工作流。它可发现多渠道信息源、采集网页内容、对来源进行评分，并支持跨源融合与异步研究。用户可按行业、公司、人名或技术问题整理资料，也可将结果输出为 Markdown 等格式。搜索会向外部搜索服务发送研究查询；Exa 搜索和 OpenAI 等 LLM provider 可选使用对应 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:21-28","scripts/infoseek_mcp_server.py:83-101","scripts/mcp_tools_search.py:28-50","scripts/infoseek_pipeline.py:90-94","core/llm_router.py:68-75"]}
{"unit_id":"GYINT__infoseek#card-en","repo":"GYINT/infoseek","commit":"d7b81fdca5c39704a23609f8b00e04e11cf2d654","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Infoseek is a DSH research skill that registers SKILL.md for agents. It supports topic research through multi-source search, web collection, source scoring, cross-source analysis, and structured reports. Searches send queries to external providers; optional Exa and LLM services use API keys.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:21-28","scripts/infoseek_mcp_server.py:83-101","scripts/mcp_tools_search.py:28-50","scripts/infoseek_pipeline.py:90-94","core/llm_router.py:68-75"]}
