{"unit_id":"GYINT__infoseek#feature-multi-source-search","repo":"GYINT/infoseek","commit":"d7b81fdca5c39704a23609f8b00e04e11cf2d654","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Infoseek 的功能「多源锚点搜索」：按研究主题并行搜索并返回候选来源及标题、链接和摘要；通过搜索工具输入主题触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["scripts/mcp_tools_search.py:28-65","scripts/infoseek_pipeline.py:85-112"]}
{"unit_id":"GYINT__infoseek#feature-research-report","repo":"GYINT/infoseek","commit":"d7b81fdca5c39704a23609f8b00e04e11cf2d654","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Infoseek 的功能「异步研究报告」：以主题及可选来源启动研究流程，生成研究结果；MCP 客户端可调用 research_v3，也可用 research_stream 获取分步结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["scripts/infoseek_mcp_server.py:279-305","scripts/infoseek_core_v2.py:837-860","scripts/infoseek_core_v2.py:1120-1148"]}
{"unit_id":"GYINT__infoseek#caveat-search-query","repo":"GYINT/infoseek","commit":"d7b81fdca5c39704a23609f8b00e04e11cf2d654","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Infoseek 使用前须知：搜索会将输入的研究主题作为查询发给外部搜索服务，例如 DuckDuckGo；启用 Exa 时也会向其 API 发送查询。","source":"generated","evidence":["scripts/infoseek_pipeline.py:90-94","scripts/infoseek_pipeline.py:168-186"]}
{"unit_id":"GYINT__infoseek#caveat-optional-keys","repo":"GYINT/infoseek","commit":"d7b81fdca5c39704a23609f8b00e04e11cf2d654","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Infoseek 使用前须知：Exa 搜索和 OpenAI LLM provider 可选使用各自的 API key；相应 provider endpoint 在源码中配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["scripts/infoseek_pipeline.py:168-186","core/llm_router.py:68-75"]}
